Notes:
- reader build only (no writer); extends format coverage to DataMatrix,
  Aztec, Micro QR, Codabar, DataBar, ... which ZBar does not detect
- the bundle's locateFile fallback points to the CDN; the engine instead
  fetches the local zxing_reader.wasm and passes it as wasmBinary:
  prepareZXingModule({overrides: {wasmBinary}, fireImmediately: true})
